===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[dense]], but generally [[small]],  [[growth]] of [[shrub]]s, [[bush]]es or small [[tree]]s; a [[copse]].
# {{context|computing|figurative}} The [[collection]] of many small linked [[file]]s created when a [[document]] is saved in [[HTML]] format by some [[word processor]]s and [[web site]] creation [[software]].

